# P8 / P9: the Play stop lock on the Mini. It has no Config key and no encoder: hold Menu, Right x3 + Down is the Config box (box 7),
# releasing Menu opens Config, the Features row turns with tap Down. Back on the Pattern screen (Menu box 0) Play starts the pattern,
# a second Play does NOT stop it, Shift + Play stops it.
# plus_flows.sh reads the play state afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_PLAY): the trace must be exactly "playing 1" then "playing 0".
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Play stop lock on the Mini (P8)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right x3
wait 200ms
tap Down
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
tap Left x3
wait 300ms
tap Up x12
wait 300ms
use open-config-group group="Features"
use seek-row text="Play stop lock"
tap F8
wait 500ms
tap F8
wait 500ms
use expect-text text="On: Play does not stop a running song"
tap Down
wait 600ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Up
wait 200ms
tap Left x3
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
use play wait=1500ms
tap Play
wait 1200ms
expect no-text "0m:00s"
shot locked-still-playing
use shift-tap key=Play wait=1s
expect text "0m:00s"
shot stopped
